        <p>With Tian Xiang, consider fairness, roles, and agreed responsibilities. With Po Jun, ask how the couple manages change and disruption. With Qi Sha, pay attention to independence and how strongly each person defends a position. These are questions to investigate, not predictions of a particular marriage.</p>
